Maximum Submissions
A participant can make 1 submission every 30 seconds. If a contest lasts for 𝑋 minutes, what is the maximum number of submissions that the participant can make during it?
It is also given that the participant cannot make any submission in the last 5 seconds of the contest.

input
4
1
2
3
4

output
2
4
6
8

======
t=int(input())
for i in range(t):
    x=int(input())
    t1=x*60
    print(t1//30)
